LUMA SUMMARY:
Detailed isolated diagnostic of a floating down-arrow in the GPT UI and its possible interaction with MMRC wait state. Repeated attempts fail to reproduce the exact hang, so the team deliberately stops speculating and returns to the broader browser-access architecture. The resulting v1.9 specification includes probe/attach/verify, configurable CDP, isolated browser profiles, backoff polling, browser discovery/launch, and viewport reset.
